From 48f5589fea20b81a37dc63e929b8c063afe55e16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vocab-kit <local@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:59:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] vocab: FSRS-6 core, bank parser and host tests

Pure-C core (stdio only) so the same code runs on device and in CTest:
- bank.bin parser with on-demand index reads (no 140 KB RAM copy)
- day queue: due reviews + new-word quota, interleaved
- learning steps (1 min / 10 min) and FSRS-6 review scheduling
- snapshot + append-only journal for crash-safe progress
- classic Ebbinghaus mode sharing the same state records
